[
    {
        "content": "<p>I want to make a command that is able to add LSP suggestions similar to what tactics like <code>try?</code> do but with a command instead of a tactic.</p>\n<p>I found<a href=\"https://lean-lang.org/doc/api/Lean/Meta/Tactic/TryThis.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.TryThis.addSuggestion\">TryThis.addSuggestion</a> and <a href=\"https://lean-lang.org/doc/api/Lean/Meta/Hint.html#Lean.Meta.Hint.mkSuggestionsMessage\">Hint.mkSuggestionMessage</a> but neither of them work with <a href=\"https://lean-lang.org/doc/api/Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElabM\">CommandElabM</a></p>",
        "id": 576903435,
        "sender_full_name": "Syed Shaazib Tanvir",
        "timestamp": 1772522899
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>There is <code>Lean.Elab.Command.liftCoreM</code> which runs a <code>CoreM</code> term in <code>CommandElabM</code>. You might find this <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/wiki/Monad-map\">monad map</a> helpful.<br>\nHere's an example of using it:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">\"test\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Command</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">liftCoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TryThis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addSuggestion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">suggestion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"hi\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">test</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 577015305,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Paul",
        "timestamp": 1772553800
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thank You, this was exactly what I was looking for.</p>",
